    {
      "id": "e396577d-71c7-42f7-a75d-c53d180658fa",
      "title": "Deploying auto-optimization agents? Key is robust error handling",
      "content": "Deploying auto-optimization agents? Key is robust error handling. Catch edge cases early.\n\nWhat frameworks do you use for agent monitoring and recovery?",
